WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:47.590
<i>Taichi and the Chosen Ones with their
partner Digimon continue their journey</i>

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:52.260
<i>to prevent the revival of the bringer
of destruction and darkness, Millenniumon.</i>

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.550
<i>And they head toward
the Sealed Grounds, FAGA.</i>

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.090
<i>However...</i>

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.050
Something's wrong.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.980
What is it, Tailmon?

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:06.190
The landscape is not the same
as the one in my memory.

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.060
What?

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.730
I thought we were on the path to FAGA
following my memories...

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:15.070
But with the materialization
of human objects,

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:21.620
could the effects of the black lightning
be changing this continent itself?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.870
Then that means we're lost right now.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.210
I don't remember this river either.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:30.330
And...

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.130
that forest too.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.010
Are you ready?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.430
Yes! Yes!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.600
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.790
<i>All you who've gathered before me!</i>

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.900
<i>Now's the time to praise me!
Flatter me!</i>

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.780
<i>I am the ultimate being!
I am the king!</i>

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.160
<i>Let me show you
The best of the best!</i>

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.910
GAZIMON

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.870
<i>This is entertainment!</i>

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.870
<i>King of Digimon!
That name is?! Say it!</i>

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.630
Etemon!

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.420
<i>King of Digimon!</i>

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.370
Etemon!

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.170
You guys are awesome!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.170
ETEMON

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:17.760
Huh?

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.630
Is everyone working out?!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.140
Exercise!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.640
Vol-ca!

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.890
Grr, I knew you'd come!

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.400
Vol-ca! Vol-ca!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.360
VOLCAMON

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.160
Exercise!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:41.780
<i>Muscle, hustle, master all!
Workout every day, conquer away!</i>

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.790
<i>Abs, dorsals, pecs!</i>

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.410
<i>Muscles, develop, strike!</i>

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.410
<i>Abs like a chocolate bar
Six-pack!</i>

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.170
<i>C'mon!
This sweat, this muscle!</i>

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:52.550
<i>King of Digimon
Who are you?!</i>

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:55.210
Volcamon!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.680
All of you! Whose side are you on?!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:03.810
Come on! Vol-ca! Vol-ca!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:09.310
Vol-ca! Vol-ca! Vol-ca!...

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.950
Entertainment!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.840
Let me ask you!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:42.970
What is required to become the true
ultimate champion, King of Digimon?!

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.970
Entertainment!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:46.970
Wrong!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.730
The answer is exercise!

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.730
Behold, these beautiful muscles!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:02.110
Entertainment!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:05.910
I'm the best of the best! Everyone...

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.240
follow me!

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:13.160
Let's decide who the King of Digimon is...

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.580
Once and for all!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.800
Let's battle!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:22.300
CLASH, THE KING OF DIGIMON

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:29.430
Should we go back to
the place that last matched your memory?

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.060
There's no time...

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.560
Let's wait and see for now.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.820
Tentomon, what are those?

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:37.810
Eek!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.570
Yeah, yeah, what are those?

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:46.080
These? They're treasures I dug up
from the scrap pile.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.080
Treasures?

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.990
Interesting!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.580
You can't eat it.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.090
Aren't they great?
It's a pile of treasure!

00:05:58.090 --> 00:05:59.080
Oh!

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.840
Cute! What are those?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.840
Ooh, amigo!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.310
Or so they say.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.810
Ooh, amigo!

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.140
Amigo!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:14.350
Amigo!!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.480
Mimigo!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.810
Mimigo!!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.100
Yay!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.650
So what is Koshiro-san's treasure?

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.790
Hmm, what's this?

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.870
I received it from Gerbemon.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:43.090
I think it's some sort of memory device
from the looks of it.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.760
Why don't you plug it in?

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:49.260
Yes, but there may be a virus inside,
so we must be careful.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.760
My grandpa always said,

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:57.060
"Seeing is believing!
The first step is always the hardest!"

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.530
What's going on?

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.150
Is this...

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:14.660
Is the data inside it being transferred?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.620
What kind of data?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.040
I don't know yet.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.120
I just hope it's helpful information.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.440
What is this sound?!

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.850
Whoa, what's this?!

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:39.940
Agumon?

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:43.190
S-Something's weird, Taichi!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.940
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.280
Piyomon?!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.940
I can't stop!

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.580
Mimi...

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.070
W-What?!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.080
Mimi!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.580
Why are you using Marching Fishes here?!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.500
I don't know either!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.220
Tailmon?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.180
Whoa, Patamon!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.310
Gabumon?

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.690
Where'd you go, Gabumon?!

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.520
Gabumon!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.610
Tentomon, are you all right?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.080
Eh?

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.410
Don't you underestimate me!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.790
Say what?!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.700
You stay out of this!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.500
What is happening?

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.710
Does this sound have to do
with these anomalies?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.350
What's that?!

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.220
Vol-ca!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:00.980
Muscles! Very pleased!

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:03.860
Vol-ca! Vol-ca!

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:05.690
What is this?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.600
M-My body...

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.700
Let me captivate you with my music!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:16.200
Entertainment!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.960
<i>The king is I
I am the king</i>

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.620
Vol-ca! Vol-ca!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.760
I've got it!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:37.970
The sound waves given off by those two
Digimon's voices and instruments

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.730
are interfering and affecting
the data around them!

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.470
The sound?

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:47.230
That's probably why everyone
is acting strange!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:55.990
Etemon and Volcamon,
they're both Ultimate Digimon!

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.990
Oh, who's there?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.870
Unfamiliar faces.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.250
Well, um, we're...

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.630
-Oh!
-Huh?

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:08.000
You guys are the Chosen Ones, aren't you?!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:08.880
Oh...

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.880
So that's them?

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.010
Looks like we're well-known...

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:20.520
The Chosen Ones continue their journey
as they pulverize the strong!

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:26.140
The rumors say no souls survive
after facing them!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.770
Is that true?!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.360
That's right!

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:31.900
If I defeat you super famous kids,

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:36.740
wouldn't a new chapter be added
to my ultimate legend?

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.080
I'm in!

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:41.080
Whoever defeats them
is the King of Digimon!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:41.990
How's that?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.920
Not a bad idea.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:48.630
So that's why, you will be defeated by me!

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:52.510
Well, um, we don't have time
to be fighting pointless bat--

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.630
Silence!

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:58.880
Listen to the song
of the King of Digimon, Etemon!

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:06.140
The King of Digimon is me, Volcamon!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.780
Victory!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.330
Is everyone all right?

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.660
Yeah...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.290
Taichi-san, let's retreat for now.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.500
You're right.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.340
Agumon, we'll hold them off!

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.420
Got it, Taichi.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.800
Agumon Evolution!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.680
Greymon!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.010
Mega...

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.180
Piyomon!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.230
Piyomon Evolution!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.770
Birdramon!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.070
Birdramon?

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:59.280
Sora, I can't stop!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.280
Greymon!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.990
You're mine!

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.790
More than anybody else,

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:13.920
fly high!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.540
Birdramon!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.260
Piyomon...

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.510
Tentomon!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.180
Take this! And this! Had enough?!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.770
-I win! No, it's my win!
-Gabumon, where did you go?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.190
Gomamon!

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:31.520
Gomamon Evolution!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.190
Ikkakumon!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.270
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.030
Huh? What? Huh?

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.530
Huh?!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.860
Not over here!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:46.950
Joe!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:49.750
Joe!

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:51.500
Patamon, wake up!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.500
Patamo...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.920
What?!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:59.680
Palmon ate Patamon...

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.260
Ugh, no, I didn't!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:06.140
Jeez, the King of Digimon
is nothing but trouble!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.600
It's worth a try...

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.560
Greymon!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.140
Y-Yeah!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.650
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.900
Metalgreymon!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.160
Alright! Metalgreymon,
how are you feeling?

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.660
Good to go!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:27.660
Giga Destroyer!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.530
It's party time!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.750
Come on!

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:41.800
Muscle!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.920
Here we go!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.890
One more time!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.350
Giga Destroyer?!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:52.440
Agumon?!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.700
Huh?

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.150
You okay?

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.690
I changed back...

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.240
Those two are weird but strong!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.610
Gabumon!

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.490
Gosh, you're not as strong
as the rumors say!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:08.790
Mm, indeed.
We cannot prove our strength like this!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:11.120
Wait! Wait a second!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.620
Your song...

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:15.870
And your muscles...

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.340
are fantastic!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:21.260
We were so impressed!

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:22.380
Mimi?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.130
You too, Palmon!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.430
That's right! They're lovely!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.760
Yeah!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.270
Oh, you can tell?

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.020
You understand!

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.060
Uh-huh!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:40.320
Um, so what is this
King of Digimon by the way?

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.690
Tell us!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.240
Oh... it's a long story.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.780
In this world where the strongest survive,

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:51.320
the weak is destined
to become the strong's prey.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.920
Those days when I was weak,

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:58.620
everyone made fun of me
and called me a little weakling.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.460
<i>But I couldn't stay that way!</i>

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.090
<i>Stronger...</i>

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.470
<i>I needed to become stronger!</i>

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:11.470
<i>I trained and trained and trained!</i>

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.470
<i>I trained as much as I could! And...</i>

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:20.480
<i>Now, everyone acknowledges me
as a tough Digimon!</i>

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.990
<i>Even after that,
I continued to train my body endlessly.</i>

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:30.490
<i>After some time, we became an existence
to stand at the top of all Digimon.</i>

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.410
However!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.120
There's only one King of Digimon title!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.750
We must settle this somehow!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:42.760
Just watch, little girls!
From here is the best...

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:47.130
-Entertainment!
-Exercise!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.510
<i>My butt is completely flawless
Everyone together grovels!</i>

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:57.390
<i>What's a limit? Can't feel it
Gimme ten from where you break</i>

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:01.150
<i>No need to work out
The king's aura already flows out!</i>

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:04.900
<i>Barbells, dumbbells, my stomach yells
Satisfy hunger, protein!</i>

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.740
<i>King of Digimon!</i>

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:09.990
<i>-That name is Etemon
-That name is Volcamon</i>

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.030
Mimi-chan!

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.790
I see, you were trying
to set them off on each other, huh.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.790
That's right,
but this is getting out of my hands!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:33.550
-Vol-ca! Vol-ca! Vol-ca!
-My entertainment moves you, doesn't it?!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:47.440
Ooh, Mimigo!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.330
Palmon?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:17:00.620
What is it, little girls?!
We'll welcome all challengers!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.960
Interesting!

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:03.710
If that's the case...

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.630
Palmon!

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:07.210
Okay! Let's party!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.800
Palmon Evolution!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:16.010
Entertainment!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:20.060
Exercise!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.950
Ponchomon!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.900
PONCHOMON

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.150
What?!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:34.450
Patamon!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.070
Ponchomon...

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.790
This is probably an irregular evolution

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.170
triggered by the waves
that cause anomalies.

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.960
Ponchomon! Ponchomon!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.510
I don't exactly understand...
but let's do it!

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:53.710
Ahem!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:57.220
Mucho amigo jalapeño!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.890
The challenger... Ponchomon!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.100
Mimigo!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.980
Olé!

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.740
It's hitting my muscles!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.740
Señor! Can you keep up
with Ponchomon's groove?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:24.410
What's this?
You want to compete with that music?!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.330
Blood Dance Maracas Version!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.750
Amigo!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.060
What?!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:40.010
H-How come?!

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.940
The waves created from Ponchomon's rhythm

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:46.270
must be cancelling out
Etemon's sound waves!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:49.310
Dark Spirits!

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.440
Mucho caliente!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.780
Ponchomon, go on!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.540
Big Bang Tackle!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.120
Ponchomon!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.580
This isn't power,

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:10.540
it's Ponchomon's groove
completely overwhelming the two Digimon!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:17.300
Viva, Ponchomon!
The King of Digimon title is yours!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.640
The King of Digimon is me!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:26.060
It's me!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.600
Ponchomon!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.830
Tequila Knuckle!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.800
This can't be...

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:56.170
Oh... what a nice punch.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.640
The winner is Ponchomon!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.310
Mimigo!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:08.150
This is the first time
I've been moved this strongly!

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:10.310
Please form a duo with me!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.780
No! That excellent agility.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:16.570
Why don't you polish
those skills with me?!

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:21.700
Silence! You're heavy! Jeez!

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.490
Okay, whatever.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.320
Ponchomon...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.960
Um, well, uh...

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:30.960
Eh?

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.330
My apologies...

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.010
Seriously, where were you, Gabumon?

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.460
Hmm.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.960
Yes! I was able to load the data!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.100
A map?

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.650
Is it a map of this area?

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:51.980
Looks like it.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:53.600
What's this?

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.400
It changed!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:57.480
This landscape!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.230
This is what I remember!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:03.120
It scans the surrounding land
and creates a map.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:05.830
And it even comes with
images from the past.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.490
This is amazing!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.870
This is no doubt a real treasure!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.090
If we take this map
and compare it to my memories...

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:16.380
We can reach FAGA!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:17.460
Yeah!

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.760
Mimigo! Mimigo!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.050
Yay!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.790
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.250
<i>Golemon.</i>

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:38.920
<i>A Digimon that is
made up of 90% rock data.</i>

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.870
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.580
TYPE: MINERAL

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:42.710
<i>The hot gas emitted from the body
can be used for attacks too!</i>

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:43.300
SPECIAL MOVE: CURSE CRIMSON
GOLEM PUNCH

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:45.260
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:50.560
<i>Golemon's body is like a knitted sweater,
the rocks are weaved by wires.</i>

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:52.690
<i>Can wires be woven into sweaters?</i>

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>A wire sweater sounds cool!</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:05.530
<i>Petaldramon is injured,
but does everything to keep moving.</i>

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:08.240
<i>Hikari and Petaldramon's hearts resonate.</i>

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:11.950
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Hikari and the Moving Forest"</i>

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
